[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 33963.51, "timestamp": "09:26:03", "text": "。不可能。這就是我努力想得到的。你好。你好。你好。我的脖子又痛了。哦，不。哦，沒事。別擔心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33968.31, "timestamp": "09:26:08", "text": "哦，不。沒事。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33981.266, "timestamp": "09:26:21", "text": "我簡直就是在追著他的屁股，想……你能動你那肥屁股嗎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33988.95, "timestamp": "09:26:28", "text": "？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33991.51, "timestamp": "09:26:31", "text": "嘿，嘿，嘿，你快動起來，兄弟。我是第一個到的。動。我要炒了他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33994.31, "timestamp": "09:26:34", "text": "。動，動，動，動。快點動。啊，他是我，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33999.266, "timestamp": "09:26:39", "text": "兄弟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 34001.03, "timestamp": "09:26:41", "text": "我的天。我卡頓了。冷靜，冷靜。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 34011.03, "timestamp": "09:26:51", "text": "沒事。該死。我卡頓得厲害，兄弟"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 34015.586, "timestamp": "09:26:55", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 34017.35, "timestamp": "09:26:57", "text": "我差點死了"}]